      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/47/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c33c00a601129aaea26375a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……那天，她对我诉说了\n她对最爱的苫小牧的回忆，\n和想要帮助心爱故乡的心情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9de91e36ebe390dea03c575fae9135d3cb6d520f2b107475f449da1803a60a88",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1099/storytimeline_501099116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        48,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/48/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b973b23cb19baf58c976c12c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从那一刻起，\n苫小牧这个词对我而言，\n就成了“北港火山的故乡”──",
      "source_fingerprint": "8dfebac5c1aa6a6264a32fcea963251576ac05a2839cb305cdc7cba0b965e97d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1099/storytimeline_501099116.json",
      "json_path": [
