    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc3847fcc0360196e7fd9a4e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而且在和北港火山相处的日子里，\n我也直接了解到苫小牧\n这片土地的美好与温暖──",
      "source_fingerprint": "503cd3d112d7d6c001f47856e9c243e50f09fa27ed6cd01bea1ed91432b9bbb4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1099/storytimeline_501099116.json",
      "json_path": [
