      "uid": "zhcn:e8d658f021092813a60667d0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我现在能明白，\n那一定是因为我陪伴在北港火山身边时，\n也一起接触到与苫小牧有关的一切。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2c94863082a1d33a2304f43bd768015736efe6555cf6da573b98406a13fd9a1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
